(7308251, 1140717, 177322, '<td valign="top">Fascinating street journalism shot.  Hope you will tell us what has the attention of these folks.  Clearly something is quite concerning. Sharp, compelling image.  Going to get better than a 6 from me.</td>', 'Fascinating street journalism shot.  Hope you will tell us what has the attention of these folks.  Clearly something is quite concerning. Sharp, compelling image.  Going to get better than a 6 from me.', '2015-01-30 11:04:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7308258, 1140681, 177322, '<td valign="top">The Almighty can create some dramatic scenes - wow!  Glad you were there to capture this. The hard line of the cloud diagonal lends to the strength of the image. Personally, I would have cropped off more of the top - but that is, of course, a personal choice.  Looks good in B&amp;W.  Hope you will share a color version after the challenge.  It deserves better than your guess.</td>', 'The Almighty can create some dramatic scenes - wow!  Glad you were there to capture this. The hard line of the cloud diagonal lends to the strength of the image. Personally, I would have cropped off more of the top - but that is, of course, a personal choice.  Looks good in B&W.  Hope you will share a color version after the challenge.  It deserves better than your guess.', '2015-01-30 11:13:50.000000', NULL, 1),
