(7308387, 1140269, 61552, '<td valign="top">Looks like Florida and the Gulf.</td>', 'Looks like Florida and the Gulf.', '2015-01-30 19:13:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7308395, 1140235, 177322, '<td valign="top">What a sweet doggie portrait. Great light which accents the brandy colored coat. Maybe the head is a teensy too centered, but with the extended front leg, the pose balances out the composition and horizontal alignment. Gorgeous, adoring brown eyes. Going to get more than a 6 from me.</td>', 'What a sweet doggie portrait. Great light which accents the brandy colored coat. Maybe the head is a teensy too centered, but with the extended front leg, the pose balances out the composition and horizontal alignment. Gorgeous, adoring brown eyes. Going to get more than a 6 from me.', '2015-01-30 19:20:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7308402, 1140720, 177322, '<td valign="top">Perfect monotone for the subject matter.  Nicely balanced.</td>', 'Perfect monotone for the subject matter.  Nicely balanced.', '2015-01-30 19:27:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7308407, 1140250, 177322, '<td valign="top">Full of energy!</td>', 'Full of energy!', '2015-01-30 19:36:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7308409, 1140675, 177322, '<td valign="top">Good bokeh helps spotlight this pretty "lady."  Maybe I would have cropped some off the bottom but the sharp focus on the subject is a strong plus for this image.</td>', 'Good bokeh helps spotlight this pretty "lady."  Maybe I would have cropped some off the bottom but the sharp focus on the subject is a strong plus for this image.', '2015-01-30 19:41:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7308412, 1140705, 177322, '<td valign="top">Composition is engaging.  I really like that you have captured the oiliness of the beans.</td>', 'Composition is engaging.  I really like that you have captured the oiliness of the beans.', '2015-01-30 19:43:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7308414, 1140719, 43565, '<td valign="top">Looks a little over-sharpened and I wish the entire tail was in the frame.</td>', 'Looks a little over-sharpened and I wish the entire tail was in the frame.', '2015-01-30 19:46:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7308415, 1140420, 43565, '<td valign="top">Nice color.</td>', 'Nice color.', '2015-01-30 19:46:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7308416, 1140487, 43565, '<td valign="top">For me, a texture that looks "old" doesn''t work with new cards.</td>', 'For me, a texture that looks "old" doesn''t work with new cards.', '2015-01-30 19:48:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7308417, 1140433, 43565, '<td valign="top">Great focus and lighting. Really makes the details stand out.</td>', 'Great focus and lighting. Really makes the details stand out.', '2015-01-30 19:49:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7308419, 1140721, 43565, '<td valign="top">Thinking your guess might be a little low.</td>', 'Thinking your guess might be a little low.', '2015-01-30 19:54:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7308451, 1140557, 177322, '<td valign="top">What a curious place.  Nicely seen.  Engaging combination of textures between the stone and the tin.  I like the horizontal lines carried between the two. The grasses and trees add vertical interest. Personally, I would have cloned out those red spots at the top of the doors or cropped down to eliminate them. Hope your guess is low, because I think it deserves much higher.  Good luck.</td>', 'What a curious place.  Nicely seen.  Engaging combination of textures between the stone and the tin.  I like the horizontal lines carried between the two. The grasses and trees add vertical interest. Personally, I would have cloned out those red spots at the top of the doors or cropped down to eliminate them. Hope your guess is low, because I think it deserves much higher.  Good luck.', '2015-01-30 23:17:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7308453, 1140721, 177322, '<td valign="top">Spectacular capture.  Initially it seems so simple but there is much to uncover in this image.  Primarily the lightening, but the river (irrigation ditch?) the green folds in the lower right corner, the irrigations system on the horizon, that ominous cloud that looks terrifyingly like a wall cloud.  Maybe there is some vignetting? If so, I would debate its necessity in this subtly complex image, but I also bow to artistic spirit.  Way, way above 6.27 from me.</td>', 'Spectacular capture.  Initially it seems so simple but there is much to uncover in this image.  Primarily the lightening, but the river (irrigation ditch?) the green folds in the lower right corner, the irrigations system on the horizon, that ominous cloud that looks terrifyingly like a wall cloud.  Maybe there is some vignetting? If so, I would debate its necessity in this subtly complex image, but I also bow to artistic spirit.  Way, way above 6.27 from me.', '2015-01-30 23:35:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7308455, 1140693, 177322, '<td valign="top">Not until I opened the thumbnail did I realize the black hunter lurking...<br/>Beautifully lit. Everything important sharp as a tack. Effective composition.  Fun story unfolding.  Earns more than 5.82 from me!</td>', 'Not until I opened the thumbnail did I realize the black hunter lurking...Beautifully lit. Everything important sharp as a tack. Effective composition.  Fun story unfolding.  Earns more than 5.82 from me!', '2015-01-30 23:42:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7308461, 1140549, 15511, '<td valign="top">Eerie. I once saw something like this while riding northbound on 395 east of the Sierras in May a few years back. The waves never did crash over, but when I turned west the next day, I got to ride in a snow storm. Later, rain never felt so warm.<br/> <br/>Perhaps more contrast in the darker parts of the mountains would enhance this image.</td>', 'Eerie. I once saw something like this while riding northbound on 395 east of the Sierras in May a few years back. The waves never did crash over, but when I turned west the next day, I got to ride in a snow storm. Later, rain never felt so warm. Perhaps more contrast in the darker parts of the mountains would enhance this image.', '2015-01-31 00:47:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7308479, 1140199, 177322, '<td valign="top">Textures are almost always something I look for in an image; this does not fail to pique my interest from that point.  Good lighting.  Tack sharp.</td>', 'Textures are almost always something I look for in an image; this does not fail to pique my interest from that point.  Good lighting.  Tack sharp.', '2015-01-31 10:38:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7308497, 1140720, 83313, '<td valign="top">Well, stupendous landscapes ARE the surest way to a high score. Quite optimistic, however.</td>', 'Well, stupendous landscapes ARE the surest way to a high score. Quite optimistic, however.', '2015-01-31 11:30:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7308498, 1140712, 83313, '<td valign="top">I almost overlooked the climber.</td>', 'I almost overlooked the climber.', '2015-01-31 11:31:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7308499, 1140549, 83313, '<td valign="top">I''m guessing low 6''s.</td>', 'I''m guessing low 6''s.', '2015-01-31 11:32:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7308501, 1140557, 83313, '<td valign="top">This one will be interesting to come back to to see if people give you what they think you are "asking for". I like it. Interesting play of textures and colors. A 7 from me.</td>', 'This one will be interesting to come back to to see if people give you what they think you are "asking for". I like it. Interesting play of textures and colors. A 7 from me.', '2015-01-31 11:33:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7308503, 1140682, 83313, '<td valign="top">I sure hope this one does better than a  mid 5. Wonderful street portrait with lots of personality coming across.</td>', 'I sure hope this one does better than a  mid 5. Wonderful street portrait with lots of personality coming across.', '2015-01-31 11:34:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7308504, 1140436, 83313, '<td valign="top">Quite a unique compostion, but I agree with your own prognosis. The collective won''t go for it. I wonder if it might have more popular appeal as a b/w? A 6 from me.</td>', 'Quite a unique compostion, but I agree with your own prognosis. The collective won''t go for it. I wonder if it might have more popular appeal as a b/w? A 6 from me.', '2015-01-31 11:36:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7308505, 1140567, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like the layers of the green, tan, blue and cyan in the background. Seems a tad overly sharp to my eyes. Not hitting the top of my chart, but a 6 for the things I do like about it.</td>', 'I like the layers of the green, tan, blue and cyan in the background. Seems a tad overly sharp to my eyes. Not hitting the top of my chart, but a 6 for the things I do like about it.', '2015-01-31 11:39:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7308506, 1140637, 83313, '<td valign="top">I have absolutely no idea what this really is. Looks like insulation in an attic.</td>', 'I have absolutely no idea what this really is. Looks like insulation in an attic.', '2015-01-31 11:40:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7308510, 1140700, 83313, '<td valign="top">I think it will perform better than you think, however not a being a fan of floral shots, it does get a 6 from me.</td>', 'I think it will perform better than you think, however not a being a fan of floral shots, it does get a 6 from me.', '2015-01-31 12:42:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7308511, 1140716, 83313, '<td valign="top">Well, you can only be pleasantly surprised with such a guess, right? It will be interesting to see if people oblige. For me, no. You get a 7 for the creepiness of this pic.</td>', 'Well, you can only be pleasantly surprised with such a guess, right? It will be interesting to see if people oblige. For me, no. You get a 7 for the creepiness of this pic.', '2015-01-31 12:44:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7308512, 1140457, 83313, '<td valign="top">She''s hotter than 5.8!</td>', 'She''s hotter than 5.8!', '2015-01-31 12:45:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7308514, 1140293, 173844, '<td valign="top">10 This image hits all the notes that make it personally deeply emotional, though I can''t say whether it''s merely me or if many people are moved by this beautiful blue, the time of year, the time of day, the seemingly isolated rural setting and the way the fog perches on the hillside.  Loneliness and exhilaration.  A door opening into the rest of your life.<br/>My favorite in this challenge.</td>', '10 This image hits all the notes that make it personally deeply emotional, though I can''t say whether it''s merely me or if many people are moved by this beautiful blue, the time of year, the time of day, the seemingly isolated rural setting and the way the fog perches on the hillside.  Loneliness and exhilaration.  A door opening into the rest of your life.My favorite in this challenge.', '2015-01-31 12:56:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7308516, 1140588, 173844, '<td valign="top">8 There''s a lovely muted quality to the terrain and the sky''s colors are beautifully modulated, orange and blue. The foreground hill nicely anchors the image.  That it''s centrally split along the horizon doesn''t seem to matter because the clouds offer continuity as they echo the mountains.</td>', '8 There''s a lovely muted quality to the terrain and the sky''s colors are beautifully modulated, orange and blue. The foreground hill nicely anchors the image.  That it''s centrally split along the horizon doesn''t seem to matter because the clouds offer continuity as they echo the mountains.', '2015-01-31 13:07:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7308539, 1140487, 177322, '<td valign="top">Quite frankly the texture overlay undoes this image for me, but I really like how the concept defines your title.  Had to smile.</td>', 'Quite frankly the texture overlay undoes this image for me, but I really like how the concept defines your title.  Had to smile.', '2015-01-31 15:14:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7308543, 1140557, 173844, '<td valign="top">7 The very pretty blue corrugated metal framing and like-colored wooden door placed smack dab in the stone wall are quite appealing.  Then there are the two trees, one right in front of the outwardly opening door.  What''s that about, or is it just a matter of perspective?  Curiously, the entire blue section looks like it can travel to the left on a metal railing track.  And why are the trees so pruned?  A fun mystery.</td>', '7 The very pretty blue corrugated metal framing and like-colored wooden door placed smack dab in the stone wall are quite appealing.  Then there are the two trees, one right in front of the outwardly opening door.  What''s that about, or is it just a matter of perspective?  Curiously, the entire blue section looks like it can travel to the left on a metal railing track.  And why are the trees so pruned?  A fun mystery.', '2015-01-31 15:53:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7308547, 1140708, 173844, '<td valign="top">7.4   Serene land/seascape.  The muted grays, blues and blacks (can black be muted?) beautifully contribute to this feeling.  The composition and the procession of planes lending depth are well-handled.  I especially like how the aforementioned procession goes from small in the foreground to huge in the background (not counting the sky) --  birds, people, smaller rocks, larger rocks, and jutting headland.<br/>.1 subtracted for sensor dust relic in the sky.</td>', '7.4   Serene land/seascape.  The muted grays, blues and blacks (can black be muted?) beautifully contribute to this feeling.  The composition and the procession of planes lending depth are well-handled.  I especially like how the aforementioned procession goes from small in the foreground to huge in the background (not counting the sky) --  birds, people, smaller rocks, larger rocks, and jutting headland..1 subtracted for sensor dust relic in the sky.', '2015-01-31 16:08:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7308548, 1140693, 173844, '<td valign="top">7.2 Really finely done.  What a wonderful children''s book illustration this would make.  The lighting is terrific, with the highlit mouse on the plate and the black cat emerging from the darkness.</td>', '7.2 Really finely done.  What a wonderful children''s book illustration this would make.  The lighting is terrific, with the highlit mouse on the plate and the black cat emerging from the darkness.', '2015-01-31 16:12:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7308549, 1140567, 173844, '<td valign="top">6.7  This egret is striking striding across a parfait landscape.  A modern graphic sensibility is at work here.  <br/>A subjective thought --  if the picture were cropped at the left to exclude at least the ship on the horizon then the bird would be less centered, and so more dynamic.</td>', '6.7  This egret is striking striding across a parfait landscape.  A modern graphic sensibility is at work here.  A subjective thought --  if the picture were cropped at the left to exclude at least the ship on the horizon then the bird would be less centered, and so more dynamic.', '2015-01-31 16:24:49.000000', NULL, 1),
