(7308815, 1140549, 173844, '<td valign="top">5.7  If I peer into this image I can see the beauty, but at first glance it''s kind of busy and garbled.  The land is extremely flecked, which doesn''t allow the eye to come to rest, and the sky is overwhelmed by the clouds.  Maybe the black and white treatment doesn''t do the scene justice.</td>', '5.7  If I peer into this image I can see the beauty, but at first glance it''s kind of busy and garbled.  The land is extremely flecked, which doesn''t allow the eye to come to rest, and the sky is overwhelmed by the clouds.  Maybe the black and white treatment doesn''t do the scene justice.', '2015-02-01 09:55:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7308818, 1140712, 173844, '<td valign="top">5.6844  On the one hand I feel that the composition lacks balance and the climber is visually indistinct.  On the other hand the perspective is quite forceful and pleasantly dizzying.  Also, the rock formation on the left is very interesting, almost sphinx-like.</td>', '5.6844  On the one hand I feel that the composition lacks balance and the climber is visually indistinct.  On the other hand the perspective is quite forceful and pleasantly dizzying.  Also, the rock formation on the left is very interesting, almost sphinx-like.', '2015-02-01 10:05:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7308834, 1140542, 173844, '<td valign="top">5.2  There''s an interesting idea here, but it just doesn''t, in my opinion, come to fruition.  It''s visually cluttered and the composition doesn''t work well --  the dynamic Bob Marley dominates the left side of the image.  The out of focus chairs in the foreground are a distraction.  And the people at the table look more like chewers than wailers.</td>', '5.2  There''s an interesting idea here, but it just doesn''t, in my opinion, come to fruition.  It''s visually cluttered and the composition doesn''t work well --  the dynamic Bob Marley dominates the left side of the image.  The out of focus chairs in the foreground are a distraction.  And the people at the table look more like chewers than wailers.', '2015-02-01 10:24:50.000000', NULL, 1),
