(7308864, 1140551, 173844, '<td valign="top">7.4 I like this seemingly simple but dynamic image of elemental forces of nature.  The foreground mountain, in its furry clarity, provides a compositional anchor.  The background mountain on the left, cloaked in snow and cloud, is utterly beautiful. The clouds on the upper right are prettily modulated in tone.  So the composition is actually tripartite.  Rewarding.</td>', '7.4 I like this seemingly simple but dynamic image of elemental forces of nature.  The foreground mountain, in its furry clarity, provides a compositional anchor.  The background mountain on the left, cloaked in snow and cloud, is utterly beautiful. The clouds on the upper right are prettily modulated in tone.  So the composition is actually tripartite.  Rewarding.', '2015-02-01 10:54:40.000000', NULL, 1),
