(7309961, 1140689, 50864, '<td valign="top">I gave this an eight and may come back and bump. A common hotel scene but somehow doesn''t look so common. I like that the subject is centered. Love the cut off lamp. Perfect grain. Love the burnt out window. Very pleasing overall. I predict 5.3.</td>', 'I gave this an eight and may come back and bump. A common hotel scene but somehow doesn''t look so common. I like that the subject is centered. Love the cut off lamp. Perfect grain. Love the burnt out window. Very pleasing overall. I predict 5.3.', '2015-02-03 15:28:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7309965, 1140540, 50864, '<td valign="top">I gave this a eight. A lot going on. I very much like the foreground in the shade and the background in the sun. Everything to the right of the inner pole could be a picture on its own so feels like a picture in a picture. I am interested in the centered figure that the picture is titled after as well as the figure in the shadows working on his pant leg (although wish he were not in front of the other two). Colors are very pleasing. I predict it will get a 5.8.</td>', 'I gave this a eight. A lot going on. I very much like the foreground in the shade and the background in the sun. Everything to the right of the inner pole could be a picture on its own so feels like a picture in a picture. I am interested in the centered figure that the picture is titled after as well as the figure in the shadows working on his pant leg (although wish he were not in front of the other two). Colors are very pleasing. I predict it will get a 5.8.', '2015-02-03 15:40:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7309966, 1140566, 50864, '<td valign="top">I gave this an eight. Love the simplicity and tones. I predict you sill get 4.8.</td>', 'I gave this an eight. Love the simplicity and tones. I predict you sill get 4.8.', '2015-02-03 15:41:47.000000', NULL, 1),
