(7310318, 1140661, 129807, '<td valign="top">This is a real slice of life image and I quite like it. My preference would perhaps be to crop off the bright edges that compete for my attention and possibly play with the processing to draw more attention to the child and the dog in this busy scene. I scored you higher than: 5.82</td>', 'This is a real slice of life image and I quite like it. My preference would perhaps be to crop off the bright edges that compete for my attention and possibly play with the processing to draw more attention to the child and the dog in this busy scene. I scored you higher than: 5.82', '2015-02-03 21:29:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7310320, 1140721, 173844, '<td valign="top">5.4  The sky is rather interesting and moody, but the landscape is not.  Actually, the tiny objects along the horizon afford some interest.  The lightning bolt is strangely undramatic.  In my opinion, a severe crop, with the lightning bolt either right or left of center, would look better.</td>', '5.4  The sky is rather interesting and moody, but the landscape is not.  Actually, the tiny objects along the horizon afford some interest.  The lightning bolt is strangely undramatic.  In my opinion, a severe crop, with the lightning bolt either right or left of center, would look better.', '2015-02-03 21:30:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7310321, 1140665, 114285, '<td valign="top">I gave you a 6, not a big fan of cityscapes, but having said that it''s done well, and most DPC''ers love this sort of stuff, so I''m thinking maybe 6.20.</td>', 'I gave you a 6, not a big fan of cityscapes, but having said that it''s done well, and most DPC''ers love this sort of stuff, so I''m thinking maybe 6.20.', '2015-02-03 21:30:31.000000', NULL, 1),
