(7313122, 1140645, 150277, '<td valign="top">This was one of my 7''s.  I love the in-your-face sheep, although sure the background isn''t maybe perfectly uuncluttered, but I still like the overall effect.</td>', 'This was one of my 7''s.  I love the in-your-face sheep, although sure the background isn''t maybe perfectly uuncluttered, but I still like the overall effect.', '2015-02-06 11:31:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7313123, 1140689, 150277, '<td valign="top">I liked this image.  I found the muted reds and browns really enjoyable, and they made the subject in a dark outfit stand out nicely.  8 from me.</td>', 'I liked this image.  I found the muted reds and browns really enjoyable, and they made the subject in a dark outfit stand out nicely.  8 from me.', '2015-02-06 11:33:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7313125, 1140420, 150277, '<td valign="top">Wonderful drama in that sky.  I''m not sure I''ve ever seen a sky quite the moving.  And against the dark rocks and smooth sea the sky has even more power.  This was a 7 from me.</td>', 'Wonderful drama in that sky.  I''m not sure I''ve ever seen a sky quite the moving.  And against the dark rocks and smooth sea the sky has even more power.  This was a 7 from me.', '2015-02-06 11:34:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7313126, 1140720, 150277, '<td valign="top">This was one of my 7''s.  The deep blues are lovely, but I just was not in love with the crop.  I think the horizon right in the middle of the image, and then with the mountains quite small in comparison to the sky and the lake water - it just didn''t work as am image that totally wowed me.  Good, but not a landscape shot that gave me lots of emotion.</td>', 'This was one of my 7''s.  The deep blues are lovely, but I just was not in love with the crop.  I think the horizon right in the middle of the image, and then with the mountains quite small in comparison to the sky and the lake water - it just didn''t work as am image that totally wowed me.  Good, but not a landscape shot that gave me lots of emotion.', '2015-02-06 11:37:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7313128, 1140708, 150277, '<td valign="top">I gave this an 8.  I found this image very moving, especially with the scale of people versus rocks so clear.  Plus the faded blues with a hint of fog, really nice.</td>', 'I gave this an 8.  I found this image very moving, especially with the scale of people versus rocks so clear.  Plus the faded blues with a hint of fog, really nice.', '2015-02-06 11:41:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7313131, 1140721, 150277, '<td valign="top">Great capture - I love how far back the lightening is and that so much of the storm and landscape is visible.  7 from me.</td>', 'Great capture - I love how far back the lightening is and that so much of the storm and landscape is visible.  7 from me.', '2015-02-06 11:45:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7313138, 1140717, 61396, '<td valign="top">I would have given it more, as I like the anticipating stare by the random crowd. I suspect the intense saturation and high contrast may work against you though. I predict 5.4742.</td>', 'I would have given it more, as I like the anticipating stare by the random crowd. I suspect the intense saturation and high contrast may work against you though. I predict 5.4742.', '2015-02-06 11:59:37.000000', NULL, 1),
