(7314489, 1140691, 74588, '<td valign="top">oh ho   5.21</td>', 'oh ho   5.21', '2015-02-08 11:00:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7314490, 1140583, 50695, '<td valign="top">I don''t think it will be that high. It feels a little tilted and people who like this kind of shot want eye candy, which is in color. 5.6</td>', 'I don''t think it will be that high. It feels a little tilted and people who like this kind of shot want eye candy, which is in color. 5.6', '2015-02-08 11:00:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7314491, 1140609, 50695, '<td valign="top">your guess sounds about right. 5.6</td>', 'your guess sounds about right. 5.6', '2015-02-08 11:02:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7314493, 1140712, 50695, '<td valign="top">I think your guess is a little low. There is a certain drama to the shot, and lots of sharpness, which DPC likes. <br/> <br/>I like the part that DPC won''t like, the disorienting composition, which makes the climber seem to be in a dangerous situation.<br/> <br/>But it all evens out, and my guess for DPC is the same as my score; 6</td>', 'I think your guess is a little low. There is a certain drama to the shot, and lots of sharpness, which DPC likes.  I like the part that DPC won''t like, the disorienting composition, which makes the climber seem to be in a dangerous situation. But it all evens out, and my guess for DPC is the same as my score; 6', '2015-02-08 11:07:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7314495, 1140557, 50695, '<td valign="top">your guess is too low. DPC will like the bright color of the door and the beautiful tones of that color caused by shade and shadows.<br/> <br/>I like the composition, which feels very stable even though it''s off balance. Six from me, and from DPC a 5.45</td>', 'your guess is too low. DPC will like the bright color of the door and the beautiful tones of that color caused by shade and shadows. I like the composition, which feels very stable even though it''s off balance. Six from me, and from DPC a 5.45', '2015-02-08 11:09:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7314497, 1140551, 12253, '<td valign="top">I think you guessed about right.  Maybe a little lower with general DPC voting.  It''s a great scene, seems to have a bit of diminished IQ -- perhaps telephoto with just a bit too low shutter speed or because it''s a tight crop of a bigger scene.  Or perhaps just post processing softening you applied.  6.2</td>', 'I think you guessed about right.  Maybe a little lower with general DPC voting.  It''s a great scene, seems to have a bit of diminished IQ -- perhaps telephoto with just a bit too low shutter speed or because it''s a tight crop of a bigger scene.  Or perhaps just post processing softening you applied.  6.2', '2015-02-08 11:11:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7314498, 1140719, 12253, '<td valign="top">Good closeup portrait of a squirrel.  IQ is good but not top notch...perhaps oversharpened a bit, and the greens look a bit unnatural.  I''d say you still underrated your own photo...I''d guess around 5.75.</td>', 'Good closeup portrait of a squirrel.  IQ is good but not top notch...perhaps oversharpened a bit, and the greens look a bit unnatural.  I''d say you still underrated your own photo...I''d guess around 5.75.', '2015-02-08 11:11:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7314500, 1140582, 50695, '<td valign="top">I think the softness, lack of color and undramatic composition will lead to a lower score. 5.64</td>', 'I think the softness, lack of color and undramatic composition will lead to a lower score. 5.64', '2015-02-08 11:13:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7314502, 1140698, 12253, '<td valign="top">A good photo with good leading lines.  Still it lacks a real "draw".  The leading line doesn''t really lead you to any subject.  To me the trees are a bit dark, and I''m on a high-color monitor which tends to reveal anything.  I think you''re close...5.8</td>', 'A good photo with good leading lines.  Still it lacks a real "draw".  The leading line doesn''t really lead you to any subject.  To me the trees are a bit dark, and I''m on a high-color monitor which tends to reveal anything.  I think you''re close...5.8', '2015-02-08 11:15:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7314503, 1140701, 50695, '<td valign="top">wow, this is gorgeous. The DPC voter will be blinded by this image, causing them to paw randomly at the keyboard. This random distribution of votes will give you a 5</td>', 'wow, this is gorgeous. The DPC voter will be blinded by this image, causing them to paw randomly at the keyboard. This random distribution of votes will give you a 5', '2015-02-08 11:15:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7314505, 1140671, 12253, '<td valign="top">Looks like a good band action shot...and a good capture of the drummer''s face.  What''s missing for me is the action.  The low angle just emphasize the main drum, and that being the brightest part of the photo, brings my eye there moreso than the contrast effect brings me to his face.  I think your guess is close.  6.1</td>', 'Looks like a good band action shot...and a good capture of the drummer''s face.  What''s missing for me is the action.  The low angle just emphasize the main drum, and that being the brightest part of the photo, brings my eye there moreso than the contrast effect brings me to his face.  I think your guess is close.  6.1', '2015-02-08 11:17:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7314506, 1140716, 50695, '<td valign="top">don''t flatter yourself. Nobody can achieve that perfect score. Admittedly, DPC voters will not handle this image well. It will give them indigestion. But this is still a 4.4</td>', 'don''t flatter yourself. Nobody can achieve that perfect score. Admittedly, DPC voters will not handle this image well. It will give them indigestion. But this is still a 4.4', '2015-02-08 11:17:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7314507, 1140723, 12253, '<td valign="top">I don''t really understand this photo.  What is the message...what are you trying to show us and say?  I think your looking at 4.7</td>', 'I don''t really understand this photo.  What is the message...what are you trying to show us and say?  I think your looking at 4.7', '2015-02-08 11:18:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7314508, 1140551, 50695, '<td valign="top">sounds about right. DPC voters will like the dreamy foggy colors, but not dramatic enough to score higher. I''ll bump you to a four for the sophisticated composition, DPC will give you your 6.2</td>', 'sounds about right. DPC voters will like the dreamy foggy colors, but not dramatic enough to score higher. I''ll bump you to a four for the sophisticated composition, DPC will give you your 6.2', '2015-02-08 11:19:29.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(7314509, 1140689, 12253, '<td valign="top">This has an interesting feel to it.  I like the overall scene square crop and post processing.  I am not a fan of the vertical centric subject though.  I think had she been standing two steps back, it would have a better feel.  Probably will do better than you think though.  5.80</td>', 'This has an interesting feel to it.  I like the overall scene square crop and post processing.  I am not a fan of the vertical centric subject though.  I think had she been standing two steps back, it would have a better feel.  Probably will do better than you think though.  5.80', '2015-02-08 11:21:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7314510, 1140442, 50695, '<td valign="top">I think you''re about right. The focus is too soft for DPC to go higher, but they do like bright colors. They''re kind of like bass in that way. Just put a shiny lure in the water and BLAM!!! 5.5</td>', 'I think you''re about right. The focus is too soft for DPC to go higher, but they do like bright colors. They''re kind of like bass in that way. Just put a shiny lure in the water and BLAM!!! 5.5', '2015-02-08 11:21:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7314512, 1140542, 12253, '<td valign="top">I like juxtaposition photos...but usually I see more of a relation between subject and the poster.  I''m missing the connection here.  5.8</td>', 'I like juxtaposition photos...but usually I see more of a relation between subject and the poster.  I''m missing the connection here.  5.8', '2015-02-08 11:22:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7314514, 1140671, 50695, '<td valign="top">Maybe you''ll reach that score, but there''s an awful lot of soft foreground. I find it a competent shot but I can''t help but imagine there''s some liquid dripping off the cymbal that he''s trying to get a taste of. Not a pleasant image for me. I''ll guess 5.74</td>', 'Maybe you''ll reach that score, but there''s an awful lot of soft foreground. I find it a competent shot but I can''t help but imagine there''s some liquid dripping off the cymbal that he''s trying to get a taste of. Not a pleasant image for me. I''ll guess 5.74', '2015-02-08 11:23:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7314515, 1140716, 12253, '<td valign="top">Wow, you set your sights high! ;)  It''s an interesting shot.  I think the blur in the main "ghost" hurts it a bit.  Also, to me the expressions don''t work as a set.  5.75.</td>', 'Wow, you set your sights high! ;)  It''s an interesting shot.  I think the blur in the main "ghost" hurts it a bit.  Also, to me the expressions don''t work as a set.  5.75.', '2015-02-08 11:23:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7314516, 1140566, 50695, '<td valign="top">It''s interesting how some shots of nothing offend me and some please me. I think it''s when the nothing is pretending to be something that I am offended, because so much of the world is like that. But it''s refreshing to see nothing allowed to be nothing, which in turn reveals its potential to become something. Six from me, and from DPC you are right on the money. 4.3</td>', 'It''s interesting how some shots of nothing offend me and some please me. I think it''s when the nothing is pretending to be something that I am offended, because so much of the world is like that. But it''s refreshing to see nothing allowed to be nothing, which in turn reveals its potential to become something. Six from me, and from DPC you are right on the money. 4.3', '2015-02-08 11:25:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7314517, 1140645, 50695, '<td valign="top">You''re about right. The DPC voter likes to be stared at. 6.1</td>', 'You''re about right. The DPC voter likes to be stared at. 6.1', '2015-02-08 11:26:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7314519, 1140659, 100831, '<td valign="top">I like the expressions and gave this a six... I think the toning might pull that down. I predict 5.35</td>', 'I like the expressions and gave this a six... I think the toning might pull that down. I predict 5.35', '2015-02-08 11:28:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7314520, 1140433, 50695, '<td valign="top">This can only succeed as eye candy, and as such it has some problems: it is black and white with a big dark vignette, and you''re cropped too close for eye candy lovers. Still there is a lot of detail on the face. I think you''ll get a straight 6</td>', 'This can only succeed as eye candy, and as such it has some problems: it is black and white with a big dark vignette, and you''re cropped too close for eye candy lovers. Still there is a lot of detail on the face. I think you''ll get a straight 6', '2015-02-08 11:28:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7314521, 1140682, 12253, '<td valign="top">A good shot...it''s a well done portrait.  I think I would have liked to see a bit more context...but I think you''ll do much better than your guess.  6.4</td>', 'A good shot...it''s a well done portrait.  I think I would have liked to see a bit more context...but I think you''ll do much better than your guess.  6.4', '2015-02-08 11:28:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7314522, 1140431, 12253, '<td valign="top">Cool light abstract.  Works well...I wonder though if it might have been better with more angle...seems very left to right.  6.1</td>', 'Cool light abstract.  Works well...I wonder though if it might have been better with more angle...seems very left to right.  6.1', '2015-02-08 11:30:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7314523, 1140705, 50695, '<td valign="top">This seems very fecal to me, but DPC will like the obviousness of using coffee tones for a shot of coffee, and DPC will like the overbearingness of having coffee beans in a coffee saucer even though that makes no sense. Plus this is really sharp without halos. You are good at sharpness. So a three from me but DPC will give you a 6</td>', 'This seems very fecal to me, but DPC will like the obviousness of using coffee tones for a shot of coffee, and DPC will like the overbearingness of having coffee beans in a coffee saucer even though that makes no sense. Plus this is really sharp without halos. You are good at sharpness. So a three from me but DPC will give you a 6', '2015-02-08 11:31:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7314524, 1140691, 12253, '<td valign="top">He seems a bit bored.  I like the composition for the most part.  Seems like too much blue in the shadows, and a bit on the too soft side.  5.8</td>', 'He seems a bit bored.  I like the composition for the most part.  Seems like too much blue in the shadows, and a bit on the too soft side.  5.8', '2015-02-08 11:31:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7314525, 1140717, 50695, '<td valign="top">How did you make a street shot look like a Renaissance painting? How did you find Aphrodite? I actually think this is so beautiful that even DPC will not miss it completely. 6.24</td>', 'How did you make a street shot look like a Renaissance painting? How did you find Aphrodite? I actually think this is so beautiful that even DPC will not miss it completely. 6.24', '2015-02-08 11:32:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7314526, 1140665, 12253, '<td valign="top">I love the perspective...what may hurt it a bit is the subdued colors and what looks like a small tilt (which is probably just perspective.  I think you''re looking at about 6.1</td>', 'I love the perspective...what may hurt it a bit is the subdued colors and what looks like a small tilt (which is probably just perspective.  I think you''re looking at about 6.1', '2015-02-08 11:33:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7314528, 1140601, 12253, '<td valign="top">Good action shot and BW.  I think it would be better less subject centered though.  You''re guess is probably close.  6.2</td>', 'Good action shot and BW.  I think it would be better less subject centered though.  You''re guess is probably close.  6.2', '2015-02-08 11:34:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7314529, 1140628, 12253, '<td valign="top">Seems a bit dark (especially the main character) and a bit tilted (may be lens based distortion though).  I love the captured moment though!  6.25</td>', 'Seems a bit dark (especially the main character) and a bit tilted (may be lens based distortion though).  I love the captured moment though!  6.25', '2015-02-08 11:35:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7314530, 1140691, 50695, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure about this. DPC might not like the softness, but they might like the glow. I doubt it will reach your guess, though. Some voters will notice that the sharpest focus is on the foreground instead of the subject. They hate that! The main thing I like about this is the subtle composition, but DPC won''t like that. This is a four from me and from DPC a 5.87</td>', 'I''m not sure about this. DPC might not like the softness, but they might like the glow. I doubt it will reach your guess, though. Some voters will notice that the sharpest focus is on the foreground instead of the subject. They hate that! The main thing I like about this is the subtle composition, but DPC won''t like that. This is a four from me and from DPC a 5.87', '2015-02-08 11:36:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7314531, 1140557, 12253, '<td valign="top">Interesting color contrast.  It would have worked better without the tree though...the door looks interesting but is obscured.  5.5</td>', 'Interesting color contrast.  It would have worked better without the tree though...the door looks interesting but is obscured.  5.5', '2015-02-08 11:37:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7314532, 1140588, 50695, '<td valign="top">DPC will like those pretty tones but I don''t think there''s enough subject for them to give you a six. This is a five from me and from DPC a 5.75</td>', 'DPC will like those pretty tones but I don''t think there''s enough subject for them to give you a six. This is a five from me and from DPC a 5.75', '2015-02-08 11:37:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7314533, 1140582, 12253, '<td valign="top">Very good bird capture.  Nice BW but I think these type of shots are better in color, personally.  Seems like your guess is good.  6.0</td>', 'Very good bird capture.  Nice BW but I think these type of shots are better in color, personally.  Seems like your guess is good.  6.0', '2015-02-08 11:37:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7314534, 1140699, 50695, '<td valign="top">I like that you took a picture of your score, and I think that picture has it about right. This gets a six from me for the meta aspect but DPC isn''t into meta so I''ll go with the picture: 5.15</td>', 'I like that you took a picture of your score, and I think that picture has it about right. This gets a six from me for the meta aspect but DPC isn''t into meta so I''ll go with the picture: 5.15', '2015-02-08 11:38:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7314535, 1140609, 12253, '<td valign="top">Great motion capture!  It would really rock if he were just a bit sharper, but that''s asking a lot (though I wonder if you could have done more in post).  I''d say 6.2</td>', 'Great motion capture!  It would really rock if he were just a bit sharper, but that''s asking a lot (though I wonder if you could have done more in post).  I''d say 6.2', '2015-02-08 11:39:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7314537, 1140694, 12253, '<td valign="top">Very good bee shot.  Something makes it look flatter than need be...not sure if it''s too much contrast or if yellows are just overexposed.  5.75</td>', 'Very good bee shot.  Something makes it look flatter than need be...not sure if it''s too much contrast or if yellows are just overexposed.  5.75', '2015-02-08 11:41:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7314538, 1140661, 50695, '<td valign="top">that globe looks good enough to eat. I love the chunkiness of it. DPC will like the girl and the dog in that wonderful relaxed and loving pose, but they won''t like how small they are in the frame and they won''t like that your title doesn''t have a guess in it, even though it does. I like small subjects with rich backgrounds. This is a six from me. 5.052</td>', 'that globe looks good enough to eat. I love the chunkiness of it. DPC will like the girl and the dog in that wonderful relaxed and loving pose, but they won''t like how small they are in the frame and they won''t like that your title doesn''t have a guess in it, even though it does. I like small subjects with rich backgrounds. This is a six from me. 5.052', '2015-02-08 11:41:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7314539, 1140575, 12253, '<td valign="top">Great colors and pretty scene.  Could be a tad sharper.  6.2.</td>', 'Great colors and pretty scene.  Could be a tad sharper.  6.2.', '2015-02-08 11:41:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7314540, 1140704, 12253, '<td valign="top">Interesting scene..I like the BW.  To me the vignette/frame detracts.  6.2</td>', 'Interesting scene..I like the BW.  To me the vignette/frame detracts.  6.2', '2015-02-08 11:42:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7314541, 1140199, 50695, '<td valign="top">I think DPC will like this HDR-ish processing and the sharp-enough macro-ness. I think your guess is about right. I''ll guess 5.5</td>', 'I think DPC will like this HDR-ish processing and the sharp-enough macro-ness. I think your guess is about right. I''ll guess 5.5', '2015-02-08 11:42:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7314542, 1140232, 12253, '<td valign="top">Good bird capture...seems a bit flat.  You may want to try tweaking curves for contrast and setting the white point in levels.  5.8</td>', 'Good bird capture...seems a bit flat.  You may want to try tweaking curves for contrast and setting the white point in levels.  5.8', '2015-02-08 11:44:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7314543, 1140724, 12253, '<td valign="top">I love the scene and perspective.  To me the aqua tones are not pleasing or natural looking though.  6.1</td>', 'I love the scene and perspective.  To me the aqua tones are not pleasing or natural looking though.  6.1', '2015-02-08 11:45:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7314544, 1140693, 50695, '<td valign="top">This looks like a vawendy shot. Somehow she gets away with things, like a black cat disappearing into a black background, and only dodging the area around the head of the cat to create a strange halo, that other photographers would get knocked down for. So with calculations for her black magic I''ll guess DPCers will focus on the cuteness and give this a 6.2</td>', 'This looks like a vawendy shot. Somehow she gets away with things, like a black cat disappearing into a black background, and only dodging the area around the head of the cat to create a strange halo, that other photographers would get knocked down for. So with calculations for her black magic I''ll guess DPCers will focus on the cuteness and give this a 6.2', '2015-02-08 11:46:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7314545, 1140693, 12253, '<td valign="top">Well done shot.  A real mouse would have been a 10 and probably an 8+ score.  Still should do well.  6.7</td>', 'Well done shot.  A real mouse would have been a 10 and probably an 8+ score.  Still should do well.  6.7', '2015-02-08 11:46:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7314546, 1140724, 50695, '<td valign="top">DPC likes this kind of sharp blueness, but they don''t like DNMC. The seen-it-before quality gets a two from me but I think DPC will give you a 6</td>', 'DPC likes this kind of sharp blueness, but they don''t like DNMC. The seen-it-before quality gets a two from me but I think DPC will give you a 6', '2015-02-08 11:47:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7314548, 1140576, 50695, '<td valign="top">well it''s sharp but DPC will have trouble getting over the fact that you''re taking a picture of food garbage. The angle and the white background de-emphasize the "butterfly effect" which is the only thing the photo has going for it. A two from me and from DPC a 5.55</td>', 'well it''s sharp but DPC will have trouble getting over the fact that you''re taking a picture of food garbage. The angle and the white background de-emphasize the "butterfly effect" which is the only thing the photo has going for it. A two from me and from DPC a 5.55', '2015-02-08 11:50:05.000000', NULL, 1),
