(7314695, 1140487, 100393, '<td valign="top">Many people will not like a texture as strong as this (I''m OK with it), but I have to say I''m not a fan of photos of objects. I think you''ll get something like 4.2</td>', 'Many people will not like a texture as strong as this (I''m OK with it), but I have to say I''m not a fan of photos of objects. I think you''ll get something like 4.2', '2015-02-08 14:48:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7314696, 1140659, 12253, '<td valign="top">Nice candid moment, good angle.  Not as sure I like the high contrast, but it does seem to work here.  6.2</td>', 'Nice candid moment, good angle.  Not as sure I like the high contrast, but it does seem to work here.  6.2', '2015-02-08 14:48:36.000000', NULL, 1),
