(7314706, 1140420, 12253, '<td valign="top">Great scene but the black levels are set way too low for my taste.  I''m also thinking 6.1</td>', 'Great scene but the black levels are set way too low for my taste.  I''m also thinking 6.1', '2015-02-08 14:53:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7314709, 1140199, 100393, '<td valign="top">A strong macro (as in very) but in the end we just have a washer, a coin and a paperclip (on wood). It''s well executed and some will like that, but for me I think the interest level is a little low. I guess around 5.4.</td>', 'A strong macro (as in very) but in the end we just have a washer, a coin and a paperclip (on wood). It''s well executed and some will like that, but for me I think the interest level is a little low. I guess around 5.4.', '2015-02-08 14:55:11.000000', NULL, 1),
