(7315442, 1140721, 77196, '<td valign="top">Stunning Image. I especially like the color of the sky - not your typical blue or grey, and the blue along the horizon on the right side is just stunning. Not to mention the lightning flash. Very nice, and well deserved.</td>', 'Stunning Image. I especially like the color of the sky - not your typical blue or grey, and the blue along the horizon on the right side is just stunning. Not to mention the lightning flash. Very nice, and well deserved.', '2015-02-09 08:22:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(7315444, 1140708, 77196, '<td valign="top">I miss the Oregon coast. You''ve done a magnificent job of capturing one of her more mysterious moods - the mist just slightly obscuring the rocky coast. I especially like the parallelism between the main land and the right main rock. And the solitary couple just adds a presence to the image.</td>', 'I miss the Oregon coast. You''ve done a magnificent job of capturing one of her more mysterious moods - the mist just slightly obscuring the rocky coast. I especially like the parallelism between the main land and the right main rock. And the solitary couple just adds a presence to the image.', '2015-02-09 08:27:39.000000', NULL, 0),
